caption: Integrated Formula
technology-rule: integrated-formula

An integrated formula granting all four increases has:

Level Load 4.

One shared modifier package.

One addiction roll.

One point of Chem Capacity.

One Clearance Interval.

One production cost.

The unmodified package has:

DPL = 10 + 20 + 20 + 10 = 60

It therefore requires Talent 3.

Integration makes the chem safer to combine with other buffs, but raises its Required Talent and leaves less Refinement available to reduce addiction, cost, or clearance.
